
### 1. Get all dishes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes

### 2. Get dish by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes/1

### 3. Get dishes for restaurant ID 1
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes?restaurantId=1

### 4. Create a new dish
POST http://localhost:3000/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chechebsa",
  "priceSantim": 30000,
  "restaurantId": 1
}

### 5. Reject a dish with a nonexistent restaurant
POST http://localhost:3000/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invalid Restaurant Dish",
  "priceSantim": 20000,
  "restaurantId": 999
}
